2 CONC  31 December 2022.
2 CONT * "Pope Benedict XVI." ''Wikipedia'', [https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Pope_Benedict_XVI&oldid=1130675977 revision] of 31 December 2022. < [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Benedict_XVI link] > Accessed 31 December 20
2 CONC 22.
